msgid "<strong>IMPORTANT NOTE:</strong> If you are using a <strong>Bar</strong> or <strong>Horizontal Bar Chart</strong>, the table interface below and available options will change depending on the number of datasets added. This setup is needed in order to ensure maximum flexibility for your chart styling."
