#. translators: Documentation post link.
msgid "<strong>IMPORTANT NOTE:</strong> In email options, field names within square brackets can be used as placeholders which will be replaced when the form is submitted, ie: [email_address]. For more information check out our <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\">form placeholders post</a>."
